Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer falls, and I\Nsee the sky, I think the rain is falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to when I was a\Nchild, who could only cry,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought,\None day I will be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Brideary and gratitude\Nfading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was\Nbefore, or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure, but until\NI do, my voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next, I'm\Nwalking straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's all on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.64,0:01:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on, I'll get through,\Nno matter what I gotta do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest of all can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side,\NWe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.92,0:02:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\NWhat I hold dear away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think my poor heart is\Nabout to go kabalooey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you slow us down somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be something!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What good old wax works\Nin a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are Luffy and the\Nothers falling from the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,To figure out what happened,\Nwe'll have to go back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The waves stopped moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How in the world did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That is messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, at least we're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take an ice pick to this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You did this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a look below.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.30,0:03:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer's clear enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle's already started without us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.74,0:03:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I got an idea that'll get us down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We got less than three hours to work with,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.58,0:03:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so this is our best chance to\Nsave Ace from getting executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.58,0:03:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to slide all the way down\Nthis frozen wave back into the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.36,0:03:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.27,0:03:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, we gotta wiggle the ship\Nfree so we can actually start sliding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Need I remind you, this is a battleship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.22,0:03:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not going to wiggle easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, you idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:04:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If we work together, I know we can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,When you put it that way,\Nit sounds pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.77,0:04:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If Captain Buggy, the\Nnext king of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,thinks we can do it,\Nthen anything's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,His fighting spirit is rubbing off on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.78,0:04:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy's the best captain ever! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention all ships and soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A new target is T-O-T-T-Z.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.98,0:04:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Commence change in formation and\Nmake the shift to Operation 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the Navy is\Nbusy giving out orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.64,0:04:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Advance all preparations now. Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.95,0:04:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe some sort of secret\Ncode they're using.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Once all soldiers are in place,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we will move the schedule forward\Nand execute Ace immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That is all, Colby. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no. Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time for arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't bum around any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, follow Strawboy's\Nlead and help move this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.76,0:04:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.16,0:05:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go on fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is how Luffy and the others\Nended up falling from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.40,0:05:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that really happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A navy ship fell out of the\Nsky like it was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Water! It's water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:05:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we were dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured we'd all be goners once\Nthe ship crashed into the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why isn't it frozen here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Gradrolls!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Start climbing! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't got nothing on the water\Ntorture we went through and impelled down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What use are Devil Fruit\Npowers if you can't even swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,LUMBAYS!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M HERE!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,LUMBAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.26,0:07:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.17,0:07:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that who I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.66,0:07:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.04,0:07:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's not the only one either!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.98,0:07:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a look at that line up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.94,0:07:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A who's who on both sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All the big names are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.56,0:07:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The world can't handle this madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Ace, sit tight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we're gonna get you out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.48,0:07:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.92,0:07:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family's messing\Nthings up again! Fluffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Straw Hat's got some company!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Revolutionary Army's at Bonkong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:08:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a ton of infamous\Npirates behind them too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have all escaped\Nfrom Impel Down somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's causing trouble again, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.06,0:08:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.00,0:08:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Straw Hat Luffy doing here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he forgot to bring\Nhis crew along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I'm so relieved\Nto see that you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it, Helmepo! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Not another surprise, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat! That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he must have\Nescaped from Impel Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How much tougher can this guy get?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now those are some big\Nfish we're staring at.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, fancy seeing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That boy sure gets around, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that's the famous kid brother\NAce was always telling us about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A former and active warlord hand in hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.82,0:08:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We even have the famous rookie\NStraw Hat in attendance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoker, look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:08:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luthien Crocodile what are\Nthose two doing together so it is him
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The grandson of our very own Marine Hero
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.78,0:09:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard and the son of\Nthe Revolutionary Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make that boy regret the day\Nhe decided to become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all things, you have the goal to\Nallow yourself a Straw Hat, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.24,0:09:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,After all we've done for you,\Nyou're a payage like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose to resign from\Nthe seven warlords!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather peculiar, all these\Ngroups uniting against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt everyone here has\Na common goal in this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all too different\Nfor that to make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd Crocodile go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the sucker chickened\Nout and left us high and dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, there he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, you're supposed to wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.30,0:10:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going straight for Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,straw that knows too well what my strengths\Nand weaknesses are once you touch water
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.76,0:10:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can't turn into sand anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, there's only\None reason I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to save your brother\Nso bad, stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm killing Whitebeard\Nand you can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.42,0:11:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So that old guy is Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.98,0:11:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.68,0:11:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Ace's friend, so I'm not\Ngoing to let him get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It runs in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get close to Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When you came back from\NEast Blue missing an arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you better believe the rumors were flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I was pretty curious myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.60,0:11:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can ask you face to face, what\Nenemy did you give that left arm to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:12:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I gave it to a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.78,0:12:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Squirt, that straw\Nhat that you're wearing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks exactly like the one\Nred-haired Shanks used to have on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, how do you and\NShanks know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. It was his\Nhat, he left it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it pops look\Nthis dork is my kid brother
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You came here to rescue your\Nbig brother, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.42,0:12:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have the slightest idea\Nwho our forces are up against?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A squirt like you is gonna\Nget slaughtered real easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.72,0:12:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you don't know\Nyou don't even know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.82,0:12:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you want to be the king, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.44,0:12:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,First, you've got to go\Nthrough me. Got it! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.48,0:13:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cheeky little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come crying to me for help if\Nyou get a few boo-boos, spoiled brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.93,0:13:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not all old like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the one to rescue Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.28,0:13:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's competing. With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I would assume this is\Nall punishable by death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.84,0:13:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They're throwing out the schedule\Nfor an immediate execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.16,0:14:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you positive that's\Nwhat you heard them say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.66,0:14:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they said they got to get all\Nset for something first, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know what for,\Nbecause they were using codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you want to rescue Ace as bad\Nas me, and that's why I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's lucky I ran into you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, kiddo. Sure thing. No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's talking like they're equals!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That boy has got some serious balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.11,0:14:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And there he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.62,0:14:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's Ace's brother, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.68,0:14:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Third division, let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep up with the boy and\Ntry to follow his lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's lend our support. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:14:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,14th Division!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's clear a path!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right behind you, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One rookie daredevil\Nsuddenly takes the lead
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're acting like a whole new army.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Our strategy is airtight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.80,0:15:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hesitate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So typical of Sengoku,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,he probably doesn't\Nthink the execution of a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,mere pirate deserves the\Nformality of a schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The big question is what they're\Ngetting set up for first?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.74,0:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Pops,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.96,0:15:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,just in case you haven't heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.16,0:15:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,word on the street is they're\Nexpediting Ace's execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Something in my gut tells me Sengoku\Nwanted us to get that leaked info.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants us to advance. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.62,0:15:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That old bastard's too clever\Nto let his strategy get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.24,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that easily, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's many things, but not a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody climb!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A lightspeed kick?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.52,0:16:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I was gonna let you pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You fellas are awfully confident\Nfor a bunch of nobodies. Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.22,0:16:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Admiral Kizaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.28,0:16:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're that jerk from Sabo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.66,0:16:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're the boy the Celestial\NDragons asked me to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.48,0:16:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to get a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.49,0:16:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's out of his boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Death wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.24,0:16:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go home! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.92,0:16:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I knew you were gutted, but hot damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.34,0:17:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean you want to kill Kizaru, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, these admirals aren't so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.66,0:17:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the days work for Captain Buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all delusional!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you quit enabling him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still breathing, straw boy?\NYou bet! Thanks, Eva! See ya! See ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you realize the only reason I'm\Nhere is to save your rubber butt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.42,0:17:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, keys of the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.34,0:17:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.25,0:17:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Cape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's the big guy that blew my\Nfriends away and shot me across the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now rolling...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma, you heartless scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand you have a role\Nto play as warlord, but still,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,all these years we've been friends,\Nand now you fire a laser at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but your luck got away\Nfrom you when you ran into us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Straw Hat, might as well lie\Ndown, because this is where you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.98,0:18:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm full body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting a long time to make\Nyou pay for what happened at the Baratie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, Sanji kicked your ass there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This Shigure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.58,0:18:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll ring a few bells for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're the hypno\Nguy from Usopp's village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.78,0:18:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I joined the Navy to hone my skills,\Nand I've mastered the art of hypnotism.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.76,0:18:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's twice as effective\Nyielding two chakrams.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,When I say one, two, Django,\Nyou'll fall into a deep sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, Django!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Worthless sacks of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So disappointing you're that\Ncage chick from Alabasta, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to play\Ngames with you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.20,0:19:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I never play games.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, asleep? Cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who tries to pass through me will
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,be bound by the bars of my black cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it when she uses that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Heena's the essence of I'm\Ndone spending time behind bars! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.12,0:19:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast, I couldn't follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hina failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.52,0:19:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one who failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.74,0:19:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Hina's truly taken us\Ncaptive now, both body and soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do they all have to be so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.33,0:20:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's as high-spirited as\Never. I see. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can cut off his shadow again and\Nthen plant it inside the new zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise, my zombie soldiers! It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.42,0:20:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now are you listening? Good. Capture\NStraw Hat and bring them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.28,0:20:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want him alive
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.78,0:20:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to deal with that creep now
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There are more of them! Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We are standing on a battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.42,0:21:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got plenty of fresh\Ncorpses scattered about
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.08,0:21:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to pick and choose from\NCapture Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one that caused that jailbreak!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.52,0:21:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be enough\Nofficers to keep the kid busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't keep bouncing\Naround like that forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.14,0:21:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.08,0:22:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?\NYou became a pirate because I wanted to!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.44,0:22:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You only went to sea\Nbecause you were following
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,me but I've got my own damn\Nlife without you in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.40,0:22:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already got enough of my own friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.78,0:22:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace. You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.18,0:22:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to stay the hell away\Nfrom me You really want to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.50,0:22:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A scrawny wimp like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think I'd even\Nwant something like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just humiliating.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.98,0:22:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.28,0:23:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.52,0:23:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, I can't let you die here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.84,0:23:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.04,0:23:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.58,0:23:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.38,0:23:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.74,0:23:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All it takes to become\Nbrothers is to share some sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.02,0:23:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,From here on out, we're\Nhonest-to-goodness brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.38,0:23:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I just hear them say\Nthat they're brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.14,0:23:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So then he's also Roger's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.14,0:23:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But both of these says Paris were dead\Nwhen he was born That can't be possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.24,0:23:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,can't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn what you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.58,0:23:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.54,0:23:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You stubborn jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.10,0:24:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Move out, zombie soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.14,0:24:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack and capture!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.24,0:24:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Seawater!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.54,0:24:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.45,0:24:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They came from Devil Fruit powers,\Nand thus, they are weak to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.32,0:24:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Press on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.46,0:24:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,These zombies will prove no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.46,0:24:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.37,0:24:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,First son of the sea, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.88,0:24:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to fight a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.28,0:24:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.19,0:24:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.11,0:24:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you're making a mockery of the Navy by\Nletting this rookie take control of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.14,0:24:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.90,0:24:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush this squirt into paste.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake, he's a\Ntooth red in the making.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.32,0:24:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He was raised alongside\NFirefist Ace as his stepbrother.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.22,0:24:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And if that's not bad enough, he's the\Nbiological son of the revolutionary dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.08,0:25:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just say what I think he said?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.08,0:25:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the son of the worst\Ncriminal in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.32,0:25:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes you think twice\Nabout who you punch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.94,0:25:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't anyone tell me that's his dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.28,0:25:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.98,0:25:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.98,0:25:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, it wouldn't bother me if\Nyour father was the devil himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.28,0:25:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.62,0:25:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.16,0:25:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.42,0:25:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,GUMGUM PISTOL!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.28,0:25:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally understand what\Nhappened at Log Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.82,0:25:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It only makes sense that\NDragon would save his own son.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.32,0:25:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what he just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.22,0:25:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he meet the dragon head office?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.80,0:25:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.96,0:25:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling from Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.32,0:25:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got huge news.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.96,0:25:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're talking worldwide headlines here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.18,0:26:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll just have to kill him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.06,0:26:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.26,0:26:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to hide it any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.74,0:26:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not like it's\Ngonna make his life any
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.28,0:26:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,worse since he's already\Na notorious outlaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.96,0:26:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You two brothers are both damn fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.54,0:26:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dirt gear!
